   "post_data": {
    "post_id": 809858,
    "post_type": "forum",
    "topic_id": 142945,
    "poster_id": 18016,
    "post_rendered": "Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/7/027f4a11d6090f9eac0ce2488df6384dad1263ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$I$\"  width=\"9\" height=\"12\" > be the center of the incircle of non-isosceles triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/d/65db46e8970b87ef3beb561c13d09b81527a6711.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC,A_{1}=AI\\cap BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"167\" height=\"16\" > and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/4/3647462eb1da32b4faab10ce1d5696c18aeedc39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B_{1}=BI\\cap AC.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"120\" height=\"15\" > Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/0/740664db064f415f7ba6d4f27d58a88e602fa516.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l_{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"12\" height=\"15\" > be the line through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/6/d3645fa769fd8028b5fb6939c519333027340042.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" > which is parallel to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\"  width=\"27\" height=\"13\" > and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/d/ddd660da8ceecbaf3a3ffb212156ff668120d8b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l_{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"11\" height=\"15\" > be the line through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/5/97531e1861626687838b2e7ff029fc9d18c69871.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B_{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" > parallel to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/f/b3f6f7cd16a47f33bebcf3fc361eeb808b630504.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC.$\"  width=\"31\" height=\"12\" > Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/c/6fc1c098ff8a0e709edca0d2c2ce881188bd1f6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l_{a}\\cap CI=A_{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"15\" > and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/4/ce47e75cebf01b8e566ca88bfb53c2d38fa64526.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l_{b}\\cap CI=B_{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"15\" > Also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/c/7ac50c944040a51657759f8a779faa5cb4ca26fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N=AA_{2}\\cap BB_{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"15\" > and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\"  width=\"19\" height=\"12\" > is the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/c/8ecee609050b0744995a1b79ec0fcd162a97441b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB.$\"  width=\"32\" height=\"13\" > If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/b/9cb2d5931c94f48cde0a67b9ca527a17490d3b42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CN\\parallel IM$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"78\" height=\"19\" > find <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/0/e50a60c5bb114408fbc9e10c29ca2aa5d9d61781.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{CN}{IM}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"33\" height=\"37\" >.</span>",
    "post_canonical": "Let $I$ be the center of the incircle of non-isosceles triangle $ABC,A_{1}=AI\\cap BC$ and $B_{1}=BI\\cap AC.$ Let $l_{a}$ be the line through $A_{1}$ which is parallel to $AC$ and $l_{b}$ be the line through $B_{1}$ parallel to $BC.$ Let $l_{a}\\cap CI=A_{2}$ and $l_{b}\\cap CI=B_{2}.$ Also $N=AA_{2}\\cap BB_{2}$ and $M$ is the midpoint of $AB.$ If $CN\\parallel IM$ find $\\frac{CN}{IM}$.",
